# The hub team's intake: the one repo with several writers, so the one
# with field-level lines (docs/grainfiles.md §8.2). The hook's fixed rules
# per kind still apply: a new task is proposed with submitter = pusher;
# approved_by = pusher, never the submitter; capability_approvals[].by =
# pusher, never the submitter, and among the capability's approvers;
# ranked_by = pusher, or the member Silo acted for.
*                                                        @team:hub#admin
/tasks/                                                  @authenticated(create) @silo(create,update,move) @team:hub#admin(move)
/tasks/**/*.task.md:state,approved_by,approved_at,rejection   @team:hub#approver
/tasks/**/*.task.md:cancel                               @team:hub#approver @silo
/tasks/**/*.task.md:capability_approvals                 @authenticated
/tasks/**/*.comment.md                                   @authenticated(create) @silo(create)
/backlog/                                                @silo
/backlog/*.ref.md:rank,priority,ranked_by,ranked_at      @team:hub#member @silo
/grain.config.md                                         @team:hub#admin
/.grainconfig                                            @team:hub#admin
/GRAINOWNERS                                             @team:hub#admin
